          "memory": "On the morning of September 25, 2026, Jen's cute polka-dot umbrella broke on her walk to work when a gust flipped it inside out and snapped a spoke; her left shoulder was left drenched, shoes squeaking, and after about two years of use she tossed it and planned to buy a cheap replacement at the drugstore across the street at lunch.",
